        "text": "Prior/update/interval: persistence prior on the latest same-variant DOL SA print is 215k, historical sample is the 13 official weekly values 208,215,190,199,212,210,212,225,230,227,216,217,215, adjustment components are +0.94k toward the 218.75k 4-week average plus +0.5k for mild labor-market softness, giving 216.44k rounded to 216k. Interval method uses realized dispersion of these flow values, chosen over one-week change volatility because July holiday seasonality can affect the level as well as the weekly change: n=13, sum=2776, sumsq=594202, sigma = sqrt((594202-(2776*2776/13))/12) = 10.875 thousand, and 80% half-width = 1.28*sigma = 13.920 thousand; 216.44 +/- 13.92 gives 202.52 to 230.36, rounded outward to 202k to 231k."
